[10.522041, "o", "\u001b[1mdiff --cc _includes/about.md\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[1mindex ebf11b4,7561d9e..0000000\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[1m--- a/_includes/about.md\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[1m+++ b/_includes/about.md\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[36m@@@ -1,3 -1,3 +1,9 @@@\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m++<<<<<<< HEAD\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m +I am a sixth PhD candidate at the [Paul G. Allen School of Computer Science & Engineering](https://www.cs.washington.edu/) at The University of Washington, wh\u001b[m \b\u001b[32mere I am advised by [Tim Althoff](http://www.timalthoff.com/). I am affiliated with [UW NLP](https://twitter.com/uwnlp).\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m +\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[31m-  Previously, I was a Student Researcher at [Google Research](https://research.google/), an ML Research Intern at [Apple Health AI](https://machinelearning.app\u001b[m \b\u001b[31mle.com/work-with-us) and a data scientist and the second full-time employee at [HealthRhythms](https://www.healthrhythms.com). \u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m++ Previously, I was a Student Researcher at [Google Research](https://research.google/), an ML Research Intern at [Apple Health AI](https://machinelearning.app\u001b[m \b\u001b[32mle.co"]
[10.522111, "o", "m/work-with-us) and a data scientist and the second full-time employee at [HealthRhythms](https://www.healthrhythms.com). \u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m++=======\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m+ I am a Postdoctoral Researcher at Stanford CS.\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m+ \u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[31m -Previously, I was a Student Researcher at [Google Research](https://research.google/), an ML Research Intern at [Apple Health AI](https://machinelearning.appl\u001b[m \b\u001b[31me.com/work-with-us) and a data scientist and the second full-time employee at [HealthRhythms](https://www.healthrhythms.com). \u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m++Previously, I was a Student Researcher at [Google Research](https://research.google/), an ML Research Intern at [Apple Health AI](https://machinelearning.appl\u001b[m \b\u001b[32me.com/work-with-us) and a data scientist and the second full-time employee at [HealthRhythms](https://www.healthrhythms.com). \u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m++>>>>>>> c499730\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n"]
